                <h3>Testing Instructions</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li><strong>Fullscreen Mode:</strong> The program finder should appear above with a two-column layout on desktop</li>
                    <li><strong>Filtering:</strong> Try selecting different credential types and areas of study</li>
                    <li><strong>URL Sync:</strong> Check that the URL updates with your filter selections</li>
                    <li><strong>Overlay Mode:</strong> Click the "Find your program" button to test the overlay</li>
                    <li><strong>Responsive:</strong> Resize your browser to test mobile/tablet layouts</li>
                    <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Try keyboard navigation and screen reader compatibility</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <div style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: #fff3cd; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
                <h3>Performance Benefits</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Bundle Size:</strong> ~13KB reduction (no Svelte runtime)</li>
                    <li><strong>Load Time:</strong> Faster initial parsing</li>
                    <li><strong>TerminalFour:</strong> No build dependencies</li>
                    <li><strong>Debugging:</strong> Standard browser dev tools</li>
                    <li><strong>Deployment:</strong> No build step required</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

